{"id":"n24931-1-7","stage":3,"title":"재수 · 运气","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24931-1-7-1","ko":"아침부터 기분 좋은 일이 있나 보네?","zh":"从早上开始就有好事发生啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아침부터","meaning":"早上，早晨","explanation":"아침：早上，早晨；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"아침","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27368","senseId":"1","lemma":"아침","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기분","meaning":"心情","explanation":"기분：心情","readings":[{"term":"기분","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20192","senseId":"1","lemma":"기분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나","meaning":"可能","explanation":"있다：可能；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"6","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보네?","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2fdd736548d881c6","term":"아침","zh":"早上，早晨","audio":"/audio/2fdd736548d881c6da93.mp3","entryId":"27368","definition":"从天渐渐变亮到太阳出来，一天的事情开始的时间。","pronunciation":["아침"]},{"id":"ebafc4e98d6e15e7","term":"기분","zh":"心情","audio":"/audio/ebafc4e98d6e15e71444.mp3","entryId":"20192","definition":"不快、愉快、忧郁、愤怒等的情感状态。","pronunciation":["기분"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"可能","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"存在发生某种状况的可能性或实为如此。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/dbec21dd545e3a43394f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24931-1-7-2","ko":"응. 회사에 오는 길에 재수 좋게 돈을 주웠어.","zh":"嗯。来公司的路上运气好，捡到钱了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"회사에","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오는","meaning":"来，加入","explanation":"오다：来，加入；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"2","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길에","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"재수","meaning":"运气，财运","explanation":"재수：运气，财运","readings":[{"term":"재수","audio":"/audio/ecf7eecfad905ba90fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24931","senseId":"1","lemma":"재수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋게","meaning":"往好的方向","explanation":"좋다：往好的方向；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"17","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돈을","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주웠어.","meaning":"捡，拾","explanation":"줍다：捡，拾；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"줍다","audio":"/audio/d734298af378155884a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82140","senseId":"1","lemma":"줍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，加入","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"因为职业、学业等原因隶属于某个地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"ecf7eecfad905ba9","term":"재수","zh":"运气，财运","audio":"/audio/ecf7eecfad905ba90fe8.mp3","entryId":"24931","definition":"有好事的命运。","pronunciation":["재수"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"往好的方向","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"朝有利于一边的方向去解释。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"d734298af3781558","term":"줍다","zh":"捡，拾","audio":"/audio/d734298af378155884a3.mp3","entryId":"82140","definition":"拿起掉在地上或散开的东西。","pronunciation":["줍ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/629283995a08e2cf51f4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.872,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24931","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.6987,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["从早上开始就有好事发生啊？","嗯。来公司的路上运气好，捡到钱了。","他都那样追着你不放，至少见他一面吧？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["从早上开始就有好事发生啊？","嗯。来公司的路上运气好，捡到钱了。","他都那样追着你不放，至少见他一面吧？"],"answer":1}]}
